{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q770293","formula":"C₁₈H₁₈F₃N₃O₃","hill":"C18H18F3N3O3","elements":["H","C","N","O","F"],"composition":{"C":18.0,"F":3.0,"H":18.0,"N":3.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Pleconaril","uk":"Плеконарил"},"descriptions":{"en":"Pleconaril (Picovir) is an antiviral drug that was being developed by Schering-Plough for prevention of asthma exacerbations and common cold symptoms in patients exposed to picornavirus respiratory infections. Pleconaril, administered either orally or intranasally, is active against viruses in the Picornaviridae family, including Enterovirus and Rhinovirus. It has shown useful activity against the dangerous enterovirus D68.","uk":"Плеконарил (англ. Pleconaril), відомий також як Піковір (англ. Picovir) — синтетичний експериментальний противірусний препарат, який досліджується компанією «Schering-Plough» для лікування загострень бронхіальної астми та для лікування симптомів застуди у хворих, інфікованих пікорнавірусами."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":1684,"mass":381.3,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC1=CC(=CC(=C1OCCCC2=CC(=NO2)C)C)C3=NOC(=N3)C(F)(F)F","inchikey":"KQOXLKOJHVFTRN-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"3-[3,5-dimethyl-4-[3-(3-methyl-1,2-oxazol-5-yl)propoxy]phenyl]-5-(trifluoromethyl)-1,2,4-oxadiazole","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"1684","atoms":45,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-7.042,"y":2.11,"z":-0.207,"el":"F"},{"x":-7.711,"y":0.528,"z":-1.54,"el":"F"},{"x":-7.997,"y":0.33,"z":0.613,"el":"F"},{"x":1.689,"y":-0.153,"z":0.847,"el":"O"},{"x":6.936,"y":-0.972,"z":-0.635,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.791,"y":-1.265,"z":-0.32,"el":"O"},{"x":8.252,"y":-0.791,"z":-0.228,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.62,"y":0.615,"z":0.01,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.456,"y":-1.66,"z":-0.163,"el":"N"},{"x":3.965,"y":0.049,"z":0.118,"el":"C"},{"x":4.899,"y":0.223,"z":-1.08,"el":"C"},{